<title>POLAND: Polifarb-C trades on kerb at PLN 11.9.</title>
<headline>Polifarb-C trades on kerb at PLN 11.9.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 108,588 shares of Polish paintmaker Polifarb Cieszyn at 11.9 zlotys a share was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Polifarb Cieszyn rose 0.8 percent to 12 zlotys in a volume of 218,294 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
